Go
--
Bil's syntax, module/build conventions, and the `tools/bilc`
preprocessor build directly on the Go programming language and its
toolchain (https://go.dev). Bil expects to incorporate a modified
fork of Go's AST/parser layer (in the manner of TinyGo) as the
language frontend matures; any Go source vendored into this repo
